[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G  state as stepping there one by on\u001b[41G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mTest:\u001b[22m a fast-forwarded world and a stepped\u001b[50Gone\u001b[54Greach\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsame\u001b[69Gstate\u001b[75Ghash,\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gpinned\u001b[96Ghashes\u001b[103Gstill\u001b[109Ghold.\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m before W10:\u001b[23G\u001b[22mi\u001b[25G change\u001b[34Gwhat every s\u001b[47Gstem\u001b[52Gtells\u001b[58Gthe step, so i\u001b[73G gets dearer once W10 adds traders' and NPC\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bjobs' work to every step.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAlso first-tier:\u001b[22m script command\u001b[37Gidentity under networked\u001b[62Gplay, which waits on N01 and N02.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Gthe n\u001b[12Gxt job is the fast-forward, I'd\u001b[44Guse\u001b[48GOpus\u001b[53Gat\u001b[56Ghigh\u001b[61Geffort.\u001b[69GIt\u001b[72Gtouches\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gstep\u001b[89Ginterface\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Gdeterminism\u001b[115Gacross\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bphysics, the docks and the\u001b[30Gbuggies. A chea\u001b[46Ger m\u001b[51Gd\u001b[53Gl risks a subtle mismatch in the state hash, w\u001b[100Gich is cost\u001b[112Gy to\u001b[117Gfix\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonce saves depend on it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDo you want me to plan the fast-forward, start on W10, or something else?\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B hav\u001b[9Gn't checked Manifest's W10 stage \u001b[43Gocuments ye\u001b[55G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 24s · done 8:29 pm\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mplan the fast-forward over quiet steps\u001b[39m                                                                                \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GUndulating… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Ru