[0.149, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G  already moved; \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlastBegan\u001b[39m is when the last skipped step\u001b[62Gb\u001b[64Ggan, which matters because\u001b[91Gthe clock's time is a running\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gsum, not step × dt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDefault:\u001b[22m a system\u001b[23Gwith\u001b[31Ghook\u001b[36Gmust run\u001b[45Gevery step. Until every system has a hook,\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gworld\u001b[98Gsimply\u001b[105Gsteps.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mSimWorld::FastForward(until) → step reached\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GIf commands are queued, or the soon\u001b[43Gst \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnext\u001b[39m \u001b[52Gs the n\u001b[60Gxt step\u001b[69Git takes one real st\u001b[90Gp.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GOtherwise it moves the\u001b[30Gclock\u001b[36Gto\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gstep\u001b[48Gbefore\u001b[55Gthat\u001b[60Gsoonest\u001b[68Gone,\u001b[73Gby\u001b[76Grepeated\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAdvance\u001b[93G\u001b[39mso\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gbits\u001b[105Gmatch\u001b[111G(23\u001b[115GM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G  additions i\u001b[19G about 25 ms). Then it calls each \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mskip\u001b[39m in st\u001b[64Gp order and\u001b[76Gruns t\u001b[83Gat step for real.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat a quiet step promises:\u001b[22m it sends no events,\u001b[53Gdraws\u001b[59Gno\u001b[62Grandom\u001b[69Gnumbers\u001b[77Gand\u001b[81Gapplies\u001b[89Gno\u001b[92Gcommands.\u001b[102GThe\u001b[106Gtests\u001b[112Genforce\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEach engine system\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSystem:\u001b[11G\u001b[22mphysics\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mnext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mNext\u001b[14Gstep,\u001b[20Gunless\u001b[27Gits\u001b[31GJolt\u001b[36Gstate\u001b[42Gis\u001b[