Gly every step, by up t\u001b[111G ab\u001b[115Gut 30\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bµm. So \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mMoveKinematic\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPhysicsWorld.cpp:1024\u001b[39m) always ge\u001b[58Gs a nonzero vel\u001b[74Gcity, every pad,\u001b[91Gdeck,\u001b[97Gbuggy\u001b[103Gand docked ship\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstays awake, and Jolt's state changes every step. That probably explains much of the 13\u001b[91Gµs Jolt-and-docks \u001b[110Gost.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix:\u001b[12G\u001b[22mfor\u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Gbody\u001b[23Gon\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Grails\u001b[36Gof\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gsame\u001b[77Gto,\u001b[81Ggive\u001b[86GJolt\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gtarget\u001b[102Gin\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gframe's\u001b[117Gown\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
