1b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix:\u001b[12G\u001b[22mfor\u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Gbody\u001b[23Gon\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Grails\u001b[36Gof\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gsame\u001b[48Gbody\u001b[53Gits\u001b[57Glocal\u001b[63Gframe\u001b[69Gbelongs\u001b[77Gto,\u001b[81Ggive\u001b[86GJolt\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gtarget\u001b[102Gin\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gframe's\u001b[117Gown\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcoordinates,\u001b[16Gthe turned offset, instead\u001b[43Gof the round trip. The targ\u001b[71Gt is then\u001b[81Gthe same every step,\u001b[102Gthe bodies can\u001b[117Gfall\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Basleep, and the world reaches a\u001b[35Gfixed point. This changes the s\u001b[68Gte on purpose, so th\u001b[90Gpinned hashes move: Jettison's\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bphysics\u001b[11Grecord\u001b[18Gd runs, the 8 world pins, and\u001b[48GManifest's on its next\u001b[71Gpin bump.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B       \u001b[11G        \u001b[20G     \u001b[26G   \u001b[30G \u001b[32G     \u001b[38G     \u001b[44G   \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
