72Gtakes\u001b[78Gone\u001b[82Greal\u001b[87Gstep.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BOtherwise it moves the clock to the \u001b[45Gep before that soonest one, by repeated \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAdvance\u001b[93G\u001b[39mso\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gbits\u001b[105Gmatch\u001b[111G(23\u001b[115GM\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gadditions\u001b[18Gs\u001b[20Gabout\u001b[26G25 ms). Then\u001b[39Git calls\u001b[48Geach \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mskip\u001b[39m in step order and\u001b[77Guns \u001b[82Ghat step for real.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhat a quiet step promises:\u001b[22m it sends\u001b[42Gno events,\u001b[53Gdraws \u001b[60Go rand\u001b[67Gm numbers a\u001b[79Gd\u001b[81Gapplies no commands.\u001b[102GThe\u001b[106Gtests\u001b[112Genforce\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEach engine system\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSystem:\u001b[11G\u001b[22mphysics\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
