s it over the step, from where the bodies are as the\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 201 \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m//      step begins.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 202 \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;117;113;94m//   4. Each frame's worlds step, in identifier order, on one thread.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mListed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDocs done. Now the format check, declaration spacing and clang-tidy over the changed\u001b[88Gunits,\u001b[95Gthen\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Ggate.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning python3 scripts/space-declarations.py\u001b[49G'source/eng…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ python3 scripts/space-declarations.py 'source/engine/ai/include/jettison/ai/BehaviourTree.h' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'source/engine/ai/src/BehaviourTree.cpp' 'source/engine/ai/src/Steering.cpp' \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'source/engine/ai/tests/BehaviourTreeTests.cpp' 'source/engine/dock/include/jettison/dock/Docks.h' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'source/engine/dock/src/Dock…\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
