[0.072, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  4 \u001b[22mstepping\u001b[19Gthem)\u001b[25Gand\u001b[29G800a5cc\u001b[37G(Sim:\u001b[43Ga\u001b[45Gquiet's\u001b[53Gskip\u001b[58Gis\u001b[61Gtold\u001b[66Ghow\u001b[70Gmany\u001b[75Gsteps\u001b[81Git\u001b[84Gpassed\u001b[91Gover),\u001b[98Gagainst\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22mb218554. The roadmap item was \"First: what saves an\u001b[63Gthe simulation's in\u001b[83Gerface h\u001b[92Gld — A fast-forwar\u001b[112G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22mover\u001b[15Gquiet steps\" (now moved to docs/hist\u001b[52Gry.md, \"The fast-forw\u001b[74Gr\u001b[77Gover quiet steps\"); the co\u001b[104Gtract is\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22mdocs/archit\u001b[22Gcture.md \"Quie\u001b[37G st\u001b[41Gps\" an\u001b[48G the dec\u001b[57Gsi\u001b[60Gn in docs/deci\u001b[75Gions.md\u001b[83G Manifest consumes\u001b[102Git\u001b[105Gat\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m../manifest\u001b[22Gda93f86\u001b[30G(its\u001b[35Gsix\u001b[39Gsystems'\u001b[48Gquiets,\u001b[56Gits\u001b[60Gconsole\u001b[68Gand\u001b[72Gserver),\u001b[81Gon\u001b[84Gthis\u001b[89Gpin.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m##\u001b[13GWhat\u001b[18Git\u001b[21Gis\u001b[24Gfor\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +50 lines \u001b[19G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe cro\u001b[11Gs-\u001b[14Gevi\u001b[18Gw found three blockers, each wit\u001b[51G a \u001b[55Gompiled rep\u001b[67Go\u001b[69Guction:\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gstatic\u001b[86Gbody\u001b[91Gon\u001b[94Grails\u001b[100Gleft\u001b[105Gbehind\u001b[112Gby\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[1B  skip, rails changed after physics\u001b[37Gproducing\u001b[47Ga\u001b[49Gwrong\u001b[55Gimplied\u001b[63Gvelocity,\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gkinematic\u001b[89Gship\u001b[94Goutside\u001b[102Gany\u001b[106Gframe\u001b[112Glosing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bits velocity change. I'm turning those reproductions into regression tests next.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThree fixes are in: the skip now places static bodies on rails too, physics' wake re-checks rails before running\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnext step,\u001b[14Gand\u001b[18Gflight\u001b[25Gonly\u001b[30Gpasses\u001b[37Gover\u001b[42Gkinematic\u001b[52Gbodies\u001b[59Gthat\u001b[64Gare\u001b[68Gin\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gframe.\u001b[80GI'm\u001b[84Gadding\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gregression\u001b[104Gtest\u001b[109Gfor\u001b[113Geach,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbuilt from\u001b[14Gthe reviewer's reproduction.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · su\u001b[76G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
