[0.309, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/session-handoff.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22m ## Next, on resuming — 2026-11-20 (after L27)\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[10G\u001b[22mL27 is done: [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116ma fast-forward over quiet steps\u001b[39m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#delivered-l27-2026-11-20),\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 6 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mon pin `\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m800a5cc\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m`. Next: W10, standing trade policies, autopilot and NPC jobs. Its fleets docked at      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 6 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mon pin `\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m736882a\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m`. Next: W10, standing trade policies, autopilot and NPC jobs. Its fleets docked at      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22m once will stop every step being passed over until observation's live reports stop changing each\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22m step; and each system W10 adds needs its own quiet (`Jettison::Sim::Quiet`), or none is passed over.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[10G\u001b[22mThe planning document\u001b[32G' hom\u001b[38G-region all\u001b[50Gcatio\u001b[56G (sc\u001b[61Gpe, the roadmap's\u001b[81Ggion supply and D-076) waits\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning cd\u001b[14G../manifest && CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 C…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd ../manifest && CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 MANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS=24 ./scripts/ci.sh \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m--werror --asan 