ges \u001b[48;2;2;40;0monly for physics to write over. `Thrust` is not state\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m   \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m,\u001b[14Gand is l\u001b[23Gft as\u001b[29Gthe \u001b[34Gast step\u001b[43Gwrote\u001b[49Git.   \u001b[56G      \u001b[63G  \u001b[66G     \u001b[72G   \u001b[76G      \u001b[83G    \u001b[88G  \u001b[91G  \u001b[94G    \u001b[99G  \u001b[102G    \u001b[107G  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 558 \u001b[22m - **Cruise** runs in the step that places an arrival, and its skip places each ship along its course.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 559 \u001b[22m   **Lanes** run in the step an arrival ends at, **gates** at a ship at a gate, a queue to serve or a\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m60\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gclearance lapsing,\u001b[33G**steering** while a\u001b[54Gship has a destination in a fram\u001b[87G, and **docks** at\u001b[106Gany \u001b[111Ghip\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning ./s\u001b[15Gripts/\u001b[22Gi.sh --werror --asa\u001b[42G --log build/gate.…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log 2>&1 | tail -3 (44s)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;218;124;92mHullaballooing…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Gate, then commit and push F6 fix · 1h 12m 5s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m89.6k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
